          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements<br>Two Story Unit<br>1st Floor | Master, King Bed<br>2nd Floor | Guest 1, King Bed; Guest 2, 1 Queen Bed; Guest 3, 1 Queen Bed; Sleeper Sofa.<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Experience Your Vacation Haven<br><br>Immerse yourself in the charm and character of this gorgeous Grayton Beach vacation home, where each detail has been crafted to enhance your story with moments of awe and relaxation. Just a few steps from the Gulf, this two-story retreat offers a splendid tableau for a holiday filled with sea, sand, and sun. Only feet away from both the beach access and the world-famous Red Bar, InCogBeachO is soon to become your new favorite place to escape.<br><br>Begin your mornings on the first floor, where a covered porch invites you to enjoy a tranquil cup of coffee to the sounds of the coast. Step inside to the welcoming embrace of the cozy living area, outfitted with a flat screen TV and ample seating, perfect for gathering after a day in the sun. The modern, open concept layout encourages togetherness while offering space, and the kitchen, fully stocked and spacious, is designed for ease and camaraderie, welcoming multiple hands to make light work of any meal.<br><br>The first floor also houses a primary bedroom with a king-sized bed and an en suite bath that includes a walk-in shower and a double vanity. Discover a private covered back porch linked to this bedroom, providing a serene escape for reading your favorite book, sitting peacefully, or reconnecting over conversation and your favorite beach beverage.<br><br>Ascend to the second floor to find another king-sized bedroom with its own front porch and a split back porch designed for both sun-filled and shaded relaxation. Additionally, two queen guest rooms and a cleverly placed sleeper sofa in its own cozy nook ensure comfort and privacy for all guests. A discrete work area on the landing offers space for those who need to connect with the outside world without disrupting the peace of their surroundings, a great place to catch up on work but still be close by for the next walk to the beach.<br><br>Grayton Beach, a gem along the coastline, is famed for its pristine white sands, nearby state parks, and a vibrant local scene featuring unique dining, gift shops, and art galleries. Here, setting the scene for memorable experiences is effortlessly enchanting and when you go InCogBeachO, you can escape into the relaxing vacation you've been needing all year.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>Two Story Unit<br>1st Floor — Kitchen, Dining Area, Living Room,1 Bedroom, 1 Full Bath, 1.5 Bath, Laundry, Patio, Outdoor Shower<br>2nd Floor — 3 Bedrooms, 2 Baths, Living Area Sleeper Sofa, Balcony<br><br>Unit Amenities- Charcoal Grill, Laundry, Multiple Balconies, Outdoor Shower<br><br>About the Community of Grayton Beach<br>Grayton Beach has a personality all its own. Its local “color” is figurative and literal, indicative of the atmosphere in Key West … laid back and artsy. Located just west of Seaside on Scenic 30A, Grayton Beach built up around a surfing community.<br>Property owners have designed their houses to take full advantage of the expansive views from east to west. Open concepts, extra large decks, and specially designed placement of windows ensure the seascapes, and natural areas, are fully exposed.<br>There are picnic areas, bike rentals, state parks, and forest land, all surrounding this exceptional area.<br>Grayton Beach is only one such exclusive area within Walton County. So, whether you travel east or west enjoying the area termed The World’s Most Beautiful Beaches, many more adventures are just minutes away.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet Perks<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.",
